WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.000
A train passes a level crossing next to a forest.

2
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:16.000
Gion festival: decorated floats with people in traditional dress; men with fans on a float.

3
00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:24.000
A temple gate with a moss roof. On-screen text: “SUMMER”.

4
00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:32.000
Path through the Arashiyama bamboo forest. On-screen text: “KYOTO”.

5
00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Tunnel of red torii gates and a charm on a wooden table.

6
00:00:40.000 --> 00:01:12.000
Traditional Gion street with wooden houses as night falls and the lanterns light up.

7
00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:20.000
Bamboo seen from below and a narrow alley at night.

8
00:01:20.000 --> 00:01:28.000
Festival float with lanterns and the inside of Kyoto station.

9
00:01:28.000 --> 00:01:36.000
Lanterns among bamboo at night and the five-storey Yasaka pagoda.

10
00:01:36.000 --> 00:01:48.000
The Golden Pavilion (Kinkaku-ji), a garden lit up at night and a pond with reflections.

11
00:01:48.000 --> 00:02:01.000
Kyoto Tower lit up at night next to large colourful letters: “KYOTO”.
